ource_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786864","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3466240-1832700592786841","game_id":"steam-3466240","kind":"announcement","title":"New screenshots and gameplay footage for The Storyteller's Festival!","summary":"Hey, Ternox here. Valkyrie Iteration is part of The Storyteller's Festival, so here are some fresh screenshots and a bit of gameplay.Valkyrie Iteration it's a mini raising sim where you play the Technomaster looking after a pilot named Lana and her mech. One run is 28 in-game days - about 30–40 minutes of real time. You pick what she does each day: train, talk, therapy, repair, install parts, take a memory chip, maybe push for an extra training session at night when she should be sleeping.Five s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T16:03:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592786841","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3466240-1808061939355502","game_id":"steam-3466240","kind":"announcement","title":"Four New Announcements","summary":"My name is Ternox, and I’m an indie developer. Recently, I’ve also become an indie publisher of small games — mostly visual novels — as I run the Ukrainian Visual Novel Jam and look for interesting projects that could use some help with promotion. https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/25363761/88a36b136b3516cbf8ce55cf6edc23fcdccd6fbb.jpg Together with other developers, we’ve prepared four game announcements you can already add to your wishlist. Valkyrie Iteration: Mecha Pilot Raising Pocket","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-15T00:07:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpos